              <p>Le pagine di struttura condividono un <b>lock unico</b>: una persona alla volta.</p>",
            @"<p>Admins only, under <code>/vsop/admin</code>:</p>
              <ul>
                <li><b>Sector hierarchy</b> (<code>/sectorstructure</code>) — the coverage chain per callsign, cross-ACC.</li>
                <li><b>Transfers</b> (<code>/trasferimenti</code>) — the <b>coordination agreements</b> between two units: points, levels and conditions, per Counterpart ▸ Agreement. One agreement covers several transferring units and several airports, and may have two directions.</li>
                <li><b>ACC and sectors</b> (<code>/acc</code>) and <b>Airports</b> (<code>/airports</code>) — import from source, show/hide, limits.</li>
                <li><b>Sources</b> (<code>/sorgenti</code>) — data import policy.</li>
                <li><b>Permissions</b> (<code>/permessi</code>) — who can edit what.</li>
                <li><b>Audit</b> (<code>/audit</code>) — the operations log.</li>
              </ul>
              <p>The structure pages share a <b>single lock</b>: one person at a time.</p>"),
    };
